  "details": "In the Action Menu action set, `Disable_Gesture_Wheel_Move_##` appears as `Disable Rotate (##)` causing confusion.\n\nFrom the `Actions.json` file\n\n```\n\n\"/actions/Action_Menu/in/Disable_Gesture_Wheel_Move_Left\": \"Gesture Wheel - Disable Rotate (Left)\",\n\n\"/actions/Action_Menu/in/Disable_Gesture_Wheel_Move_Right\": \"Gesture Wheel - Disable Rotate (Right)\",\n\n \"/actions/Action_Menu/in/Disable_Gesture_Wheel_Rotate_Left\": \"Gesture Wheel - Disable Rotate (Left)\",\n\n\"/actions/Action_Menu/in/Disable_Gesture_Wheel_Rotate_Right\": \"Gesture Wheel - Disable Rotate (Right)\",\n\n```",
